                                                "sense_id": "80a22274-554b-335a-a33f-31df3bea8c86",
                                                "text": "A diverse collection of ankylosaurs once roamed in great numbers across Laurasia — the northern supercontinent that once contained North America and Asia."
                                            }
                                        ]
